###

# 2. verify a phone OTP
POST https://<PROJECT_REF>.supabase.co/auth/v1/verify
apikey: <SUPABASE_KEY>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "sms",
  "phone": "+13334445555",
  "token": "123456"
}

